return ['domain'=>'simple-ldap-login','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'Simple LDAP Login 2.0.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-30T15:26:17+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-30T15:26:17+00:00','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['Simple LDAP Login'=>'Simple LDAP Login','https://github.com/clifgriffin/simple-ldap-login'=>'https://github.com/clifgriffin/simple-ldap-login','Connect WordPress accounts to Active Directory or OpenLDAP.'=>'将WordPress账户连接到Active Directory或OpenLDAP。','Clif Griffin Development Inc.'=>'Clif Griffin Development Inc.','https://clifgriffin.com'=>'https://clifgriffin.com','User data'=>'用户数据','Single sign-on'=>'单点登录','Custom user fields'=>'自定义用户字段','Copy LDAP fields, such as phone number or department, to WordPress at login. Your theme or other plugins can use these values.'=>'在登录时将 LDAP 字段（如电话号码或部门）复制到 WordPress。您的主题或其他插件可以使用这些值。','Field mappings'=>'字段映射','One mapping per line: LDAP attribute:WordPress meta key:type. Example: %1$s. Types: %2$s or %3$s.'=>'每行一个映射：LDAP 属性：WordPress 元数据键：类型。示例：%1$s。类型：%2$s 或 %3$s。','Custom field storage'=>'自定义字段存储','Leave the defaults unless your integration uses different user meta keys.'=>'除非您的集成使用不同的用户元键，否则保留默认值。','LDAP value suffix'=>'LDAP值后缀','Stores the LDAP value, such as phone_ldap.'=>'存储LDAP值，例如phone_ldap。','WordPress value suffix'=>'WordPress值后缀','Stores the editable WordPress value, such as phone_wp.'=>'存储可编辑的WordPress值，例如phone_wp。','Single sign-on (SSO)'=>'单点登录（SSO）','Sign users in to WordPress after your web server authenticates them.'=>'在您的 Web 服务器验证用户后，将用户登录到 WordPress。','Enable single sign-on'=>'启用单点登录','Users do not need a second login for WordPress.'=>'用户无需为 WordPress 进行第二次登录。','Configure your web server to authenticate users and set REMOTE_USER. Enter an LDAP search account on Connection.'=>'配置您的 Web 服务器以验证用户并设置 REMOTE_USER。在连接中输入 LDAP 搜索帐户。','Do not copy browser headers into REMOTE_USER. Block access that bypasses web server authentication.'=>'不要将浏览器头复制到 REMOTE_USER。阻止绕过 Web 服务器身份验证的访问。','Web server authentication'=>'Web服务器身份验证','REMOTE_USER is present.'=>'REMOTE_USER存在。','REMOTE_USER is missing. Check the web server configuration.'=>'REMOTE_USER缺失。检查Web服务器配置。','The update was stopped. Activate Simple LDAP Login Pro to restore LDAP login.'=>'更新已停止。激活 Simple LDAP Login Pro 以恢复 LDAP 登录。','Update blocked: This package does not include all Pro files. To install Free, deactivate the plugin first. Your installed files and settings are unchanged.'=>'更新被阻止：此包不包含所有 Pro 文件。要安装免费版，请先停用插件。您已安装的文件和设置保持不变。','WordPress could not reactivate the plugin.'=>'WordPress无法重新激活插件。','Simple LDAP Login needs PHP 8.1 or later.'=>'Simple LDAP Login需要PHP 8.1或更高版本。','Plugin files are missing. Reinstall Simple LDAP Login from the release ZIP.'=>'插件文件丢失。从发布ZIP重新安装Simple LDAP Login。','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','The settings scope has changed. Open the settings page and try again.'=>'设置范围已更改。打开设置页面并重试。','You do not have permission to view these settings.'=>'您没有权限查看这些设置。','Network settings'=>'网络设置','Site settings'=>'站点设置','LDAP login settings'=>'LDAP登录设置','Connect to LDAP, then test a login before enabling authentication.'=>'连接到LDAP，然后在启用身份验证之前测试登录。','LDAP login and SSO are disabled by SLL_DISABLE_LDAP in wp-config.php.'=>'LDAP登录和SSO因wp-config.php中的SLL_DISABLE_LDAP而被禁用。','Your saved settings use SSO or custom user fields. Install Simple LDAP Login Pro to use these features. Your settings are kept.'=>'您的保存设置使用SSO或自定义用户字段。安装Simple LDAP Login Pro以使用这些功能。您的设置已保存。','The saved LDAP search password cannot be read. Enter it again on the Connection tab.'=>'无法读取保存的LDAP搜索密码。在连接选项卡上重新输入。','PHP LDAP is missing. Ask your host to install it before enabling LDAP login.'=>'缺少 PHP LDAP。请向您的主机请求安装它，然后再启用 LDAP 登录。','LDAP passwords are sent without encryption. Use StartTLS or LDAPS if your server supports it.'=>'LDAP 密码以未加密的方式发送。如果您的服务器支持，请使用 StartTLS 或 LDAPS。','Save settings'=>'保存设置','Settings on other tabs are kept.'=>'其他选项卡上的设置将被保留。','LDAP connection'=>'LDAP 连接','LDAP login'=>'LDAP 登录','Enable LDAP authentication.'=>'启用 LDAP 身份验证。','Directory type'=>'目录类型','Active Directory'=>'Active Directory','OpenLDAP / other LDAP directory'=>'OpenLDAP / 其他 LDAP 目录','LDAP servers'=>'LDAP 服务器','One hostname or IP address per line. Servers are tried in order.'=>'每行一个主机名或 IP 地址。服务器按顺序尝试。','Base DN'=>'基础 DN','Where to search for users. Example: DC=example,DC=org.'=>'搜索用户的位置。示例：DC=example,DC=org。','Username suffix'=>'用户名后缀','Added to usernames without a domain. Example: @example.org.'=>'添加到没有域的用户名。示例：@example.org。','Windows domain'=>'Windows 域','Short domain name, such as EXAMPLE. Takes priority over the username suffix.'=>'短域名，例如 EXAMPLE。优先于用户名后缀。','Connection security'=>'连接安全性','TLS requires a trusted server certificate.'=>'TLS 需要受信任的服务器证书。','StartTLS (recommended)'=>'StartTLS（推荐）','LDAPS'=>'LDAPS','Unencrypted LDAP'=>'未加密的 LDAP','Unencrypted LDAP requires permission on the Advanced tab.'=>'未加密的 LDAP 需要在高级选项卡上获得权限。','Port'=>'端口','389 for StartTLS; 636 for LDAPS.'=>'StartTLS 使用 389；LDAPS 使用 636。','Search subfolders'=>'搜索子文件夹','Search all organizational units below the Base DN.'=>'搜索基础 DN 下面的所有组织单位。','LDAP search account'=>'LDAP 搜索账户','An LDAP account with read access to users and groups.'=>'具有读取用户和组权限的 LDAP 账户。','Search account'=>'搜索账户','LDAP bind DN or account name.'=>'LDAP 绑定 DN 或账户名称。','Search account password'=>'搜索账户密码','Leave blank to keep the saved password.'=>'留空以保留已保存的密码。','Login rules'=>'登录规则','Require LDAP passwords'=>'要求 LDAP 密码','Block WordPress passwords except for recovery access.'=>'阻止 WordPress 密码，除非用于恢复访问。','Local recovery access'=>'本地恢复访问','Selected administrators'=>'选定的管理员','All super administrators (legacy)'=>'所有超级管理员（遗留）','All administrators (legacy)'=>'所有管理员（遗留）','Off'=>'关闭','Choose who can use a WordPress password when LDAP passwords are required.'=>'选择可以在要求 LDAP 密码时使用 WordPress 密码的用户。','Automatic account creation'=>'自动账户创建','Create a WordPress account on the first successful LDAP login.'=>'在第一次成功的 LDAP 登录时创建 WordPress 账户。','Default role'=>'默认角色','For new accounts only.'=>'仅适用于新账户。','Required groups'=>'所需组','One group name per line. Users must belong to at least one. Leave blank to allow all LDAP users.'=>'每行一个组名。用户必须至少属于一个。留空以允许所有 LDAP 用户。','Recovery accounts'=>'恢复账户','For Selected administrators only. Use separate local accounts with WordPress passwords. Hold Ctrl or Command to select multiple accounts.'=>'仅适用于选定的管理员。使用单独的本地账户和 WordPress 密码。按住 Ctrl 或 Command 选择多个账户。','Connection options'=>'连接选项','Change these only if the default values do not work with your directory.'=>'仅在默认值与您的目录不兼容时更改这些设置。','LDAP timeout (seconds)'=>'LDAP 超时（秒）','Maximum wait for an LDAP operation. Default: 5 seconds.'=>'LDAP 操作的最大等待时间。默认：5 秒。','Login attribute'=>'登录属性','Attribute used to find users. Default: uid.'=>'用于查找用户的属性。默认：uid。','Allow unencrypted LDAP'=>'允许未加密的 LDAP','Allow passwords to be sent without encryption.'=>'允许密码以未加密的方式发送。','Group search'=>'组搜索','Group base DN'=>'组基础 DN','Leave blank to use the user Base DN.'=>'留空以使用用户基础 DN。','Group name attribute'=>'组名称属性','Default: cn.'=>'默认：cn。','Group member attribute'=>'组成员属性','Default: memberUid. Use member or uniqueMember if groups store user DNs.'=>'默认：memberUid。如果组存储用户 DN，请使用 member 或 uniqueMember。','Profile attributes'=>'个人资料属性','LDAP attributes copied to new WordPress accounts.'=>'复制到新 WordPress 账户的 LDAP 属性。','First name attribute'=>'名字属性','Last name attribute'=>'姓氏属性','Email attribute'=>'电子邮件属性','Website attribute'=>'网站属性','Data retention'=>'数据保留','Delete settings when removing the plugin'=>'删除插件时删除设置','Delete saved settings and LDAP credentials when WordPress deletes the plugin. Keep user accounts.'=>'当 WordPress 删除插件时，删除保存的设置和 LDAP 凭据。保留用户账户。','Test LDAP login'=>'测试 LDAP 登录','Save your settings, then run both tests. Keep this administrator session open.'=>'保存您的设置，然后运行两个测试。保持此管理员会话打开。','Tests check the connection, password, and required groups. They do not create accounts or sign users in.'=>'测试检查连接、密码和所需组。它们不会创建账户或登录用户。','After both tests pass, enable LDAP and try logging in from another browser.'=>'在两个测试通过后，启用 LDAP 并尝试从另一个浏览器登录。','Recovery'=>'恢复','If you are locked out, rename the simple-ldap-login folder using your hosting file manager. Log in with a WordPress administrator password, then restore the folder and correct the settings.'=>'如果您被锁定，请使用您的主机文件管理器重命名 simple-ldap-login 文件夹。使用 WordPress 管理员密码登录，然后恢复文件夹并更正设置。','For certificate errors, ask your host to configure the trusted LDAP certificate authority.'=>'对于证书错误，请要求您的主机配置受信任的 LDAP 证书颁发机构。','LDAP tests'=>'LDAP 测试','Tests use saved settings.'=>'测试使用保存的设置。','1. Test connection'=>'1. 测试连接','Connect to LDAP and test the search account, if set.'=>'连接到 LDAP 并测试搜索账户（如果设置）。','Test connection'=>'测试连接','2. Test login'=>'2. 测试登录','Check an LDAP username, password, and group membership.'=>'检查 LDAP 用户名、密码和组成员资格。','LDAP username'=>'LDAP 用户名','LDAP password'=>'LDAP 密码','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Connection test passed.'=>'连接测试通过。','Cannot connect to LDAP. Check the server, port, TLS certificate, and search account.'=>'无法连接到 LDAP。检查服务器、端口、TLS 证书和搜索账户。','LDAP login test passed. No account was created.'=>'LDAP 登录测试通过。未创建账户。','LDAP login test failed. Check the username, password, and required groups.'=>'LDAP 登录测试失败。检查用户名、密码和所需组。','Could not save settings. Check the values and try again.'=>'无法保存设置。检查值并重试。','Connection'=>'连接','Access'=>'访问','Advanced'=>'高级','Troubleshooting'=>'故障排除','Your LDAP login is valid, but you need a WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 登录有效，但您需要一个 WordPress 账户。请联系您的网站管理员。','Your LDAP username is not a valid WordPress username. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 用户名不是有效的 WordPress 用户名。请联系您的网站管理员。','The default WordPress role is not available. Contact your site administrator.'=>'默认的 WordPress 角色不可用。请联系您的网站管理员。','Could not create your WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'无法创建您的 WordPress 账户。请联系您的网站管理员。','Use your WordPress password for this recovery account.'=>'使用您的 WordPress 密码作为此恢复账户。','License'=>'许可证','Get Pro'=>'获取专业版','Could not check your license. Pro features remain active. Try again on the License tab.'=>'无法检查您的许可证。专业功能保持激活状态。请在许可证选项卡上重试。','Your Pro license has expired. Single sign-on and custom field updates are off. Renew your license, then select Check license on the License tab.'=>'您的专业许可证已过期。单点登录和自定义字段更新已关闭。请续订您的许可证，然后在许可证选项卡上选择检查许可证。','Activate a Pro license on the License tab to use single sign-on and custom user fields.'=>'在许可证选项卡上激活专业许可证以使用单点登录和自定义用户字段。','Simple LDAP Login Pro'=>'Simple LDAP Login Pro','Give staff fewer login prompts and keep user details in sync with LDAP.'=>'减少员工的登录提示，并保持用户详细信息与 LDAP 同步。','Let staff open WordPress without another login prompt. Requires authentication on your web server, such as Kerberos or NTLM.'=>'让员工无需再次登录即可打开 WordPress。需要在您的 Web 服务器上进行身份验证，例如 Kerberos 或 NTLM。','Copy phone numbers, departments, and other LDAP fields to WordPress at login. Use these values in your theme or other plugins.'=>'在登录时将电话号码、部门和其他 LDAP 字段复制到 WordPress。可以在您的主题或其他插件中使用这些值。','View plans'=>'查看计划','Open checkout in a new tab'=>'在新标签页中打开结账','Plans and checkout use PaidCommunities. It receives your IP address and browser details.'=>'计划和结账使用 PaidCommunities。它会接收您的 IP 地址和浏览器详细信息。','After purchase, install the Pro ZIP from your receipt. Your LDAP settings will stay in place.'=>'购买后，从您的收据中安装专业 ZIP。您的 LDAP 设置将保持不变。','License status updated.'=>'许可证状态已更新。','Could not verify the license. Check your key and connection, then try again.'=>'无法验证许可证。请检查您的密钥和连接，然后重试。','Pro license'=>'Pro 许可证','Enter the license key from your purchase receipt.'=>'输入您购买收据上的许可证密钥。','Not activated'=>'未激活','Expired'=>'已过期','Inactive'=>'未激活','License status'=>'许可证状态','Active'=>'有效','Data shared with PaidCommunities'=>'与 PaidCommunities 共享的数据','Activation sends your license key, site domain, plugin version, and server IP address to PaidCommunities. License checks send the same site details.'=>'激活时将您的许可证密钥、站点域名、插件版本和服务器